76561198864421333", "personaname": "KnullWerd", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198864421333/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 10643, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 14, "last_played": 1707077806, "avatar": "55ff054a5c81424eae4603b567fa322665799de0"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is amazing, plain and simple as can be.However I found out while playing you should NEVER EVER change the key bindings on the controls for this game,I tried it a while back and now i can barely even play the game aside from moving to the left only and turning my camera, (So essentially,Running,Using abilities, Shooting,Jumping,walking to the right,up and down as well as picking up items) So as long as you don't change the key bindings.I'd recommend this game for anyone that wants either a nice long/fast go at this game", "timestamp_created": 1553369302, "timestamp_updated": 1553369302, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}